        <mxCell id="header" value="&lt;b&gt;Hyperloom Inference Optimizer — v0.6 实际架构 (代码 @ 2026-05-18)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;单 asyncio Coordinator (2949 行) · 4 reactor 角色 · PolicyGate 强制式校验 · SQLite WAL 事件流 · canonical 顺序 orchestration → kernel → critic → robustness, 单 tick_interval" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#BFD9F2;strokeColor=#0B3D91;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=20;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="2120" height="64" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="user" value="&lt;b&gt;User&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;inference_optimizer optimize&lt;br&gt;--model / --framework / --gpu-type&lt;br&gt;--model-class / --compare-against-gpu&lt;br&gt;--isl/--osl / --max-hours&lt;br&gt;--no-kernel / --resume / --critic-* / --robustness-*" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=13;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="104" width="320" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="cli" value="&lt;b&gt;cli.py · _preflight() — 9 步顺序执行&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;① credentials fallback (env &gt; .env)  ② auth aliases (SAFE_API_KEY → OPENAI/ANTHROPIC/OOB/GEAK/LLM)  ③ Python SDK 自动装  ④ auth_proxy.py 源码 bootstrap&lt;br&gt;⑤ auth-proxy 监管 + ~/.claude/config.json (强写 ANTHROPIC/OPENAI_BASE_URL → :4002)  ⑥ ROCm 卫生  ⑦ Ray + Magpie + InferenceX  ⑧ node/claude/codex CLI 探测  ⑨ diagnostics&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;额外 (_run_optimize 内):&lt;/b&gt; model-gate catalog probe (claude-opus-4-7 → 4-6 fallback) · gpu-type 自动探测 · critic-agent runtime probe" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="380" y="104" width="1530" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="auth_proxy" value="&lt;b&gt;auth-proxy :4002&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;x-api-key → Bearer 改写&lt;br&gt;(AMD primus-safe 网关&lt;br&gt;只认 Bearer; Claude SDK&lt;br&gt;走 x-api-key)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#888888;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1930" y="104" width="230" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

