        <mxCell id="exec_files" value="&lt;b&gt;action_executors/*.py — 10 个执行器&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;baseline · profile · backends · params · sweep · pmc_roofline · target_analysis · validate_stack · report · session_breakdown&lt;br&gt;辅助: _accuracy_gate · _grid_runner (33KB) · _inferencex_patcher · _server_patcher (38KB) · _workload_envs · benchmark_result.is_valid_measurement (守门)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D6E9FF;strokeColor=#1F6AA8;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
