        <mxCell id="sub_kernel" value="&lt;b&gt;kernel-agent/&lt;/b&gt; — &lt;b style=&quot;color:#B47A1A&quot;&gt;同进程工具库, 非子进程&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;tools/kernel_optimization.py (107KB) · tracelens_analysis.py (98KB) ·&lt;br&gt;tracelens_skill_runner.py (55KB) · parallel_e2e_runner.py ·&lt;br&gt;apply_kernel_patch.py · geak_prompt_patcher.py ·&lt;br&gt;tools/backends/ (GEAK / OOB Ray 调度)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;调用方:&lt;/b&gt; orchestrator/kernel_request_handlers.py 直接 import" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF4E6;strokeColor=#B47A1A;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
