        <mxCell id="persist" value="&lt;b&gt;Persistence — $SESSION_DIR&lt;/b&gt; (默认 /workspace/hyperloom, 扁平; env: USER_DATA_PATH)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;state.json&lt;/b&gt; (atomic tmp+rename, Coordinator 唯一写) · &lt;b&gt;storage/coordinator.db&lt;/b&gt; (SQLite WAL · 4 表: events / tasks / leases / cursors + schema_version)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;agents/{role}/{inbox,outbox}.jsonl&lt;/b&gt; · personas/ · checkpoints/ · &lt;b&gt;findings/&amp;lt;ts&amp;gt;.json&lt;/b&gt; (RCA) · kb/ (Critic 写) · runs/&amp;lt;kind&amp;gt;/&amp;lt;task_id&amp;gt;/ · &lt;b&gt;critic-workdir/&amp;lt;turn&amp;gt;/&lt;/b&gt;{request, judge_bundle, review, emit}.json&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;辅助模块输出:&lt;/b&gt; baseline_comparison/ (InferenceX 对标 + target_analyzer) · breakdown/ (collectors.py 110KB + reporters + SKILL.md) · roofline_integration.py (36KB · PMC roofline)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D6E9FF;strokeColor=#1F6AA8;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
